{"id":"n28318-1-11","stage":3,"title":"논리 · 逻辑","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28318-1-11-1","ko":"제 글에 무슨 문제라도 있나요?","zh":"我的文章有什么问题吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"글에","meaning":"文章","explanation":"글：文章；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"글","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59226","senseId":"1","lemma":"글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글에","audio":"/audio/98d9008640c0e7dc1867.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"문제라도","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제：问题；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"4","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제라도","audio":"/audio/4423cad36ef9be9f6e07.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"f77a9ef73a929938","term":"글","zh":"文章","audio":"